[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/2.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I understand that the school organises... um, trips to different...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, we run five every month:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/5.mp3"},{"answer":"three during weekends and two Wednesday afternoon trips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/6.mp3"},{"answer":"What sort of places?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, obviously it varies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/8.mp3"},{"answer":"but always places of historical interest","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and also which offer a variety of shopping, because our students always ask about that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we go for ones where we know there are guided tours,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/11.mp3"},{"answer":"because this gives a good focus for the visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you travel far?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we're lucky here, obviously,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/14.mp3"},{"answer":"because we're able to say that all our visits are less than three hours drive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/15.mp3"},{"answer":"How much do they cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Again, it varies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/17.mp3"},{"answer":"between five and fifteen pounds a head, depending on distance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, and we do offer to arrange special trips if, you know, there are more than twelve people.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right, I'll keep that in mind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/20.mp3"},{"answer":"And what are the times normally?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We try to keep it pretty fixed so that, that students get to know the pattern.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/22.mp3"},{"answer":"We leave at 8.30 a.m. and return at 6 p.m.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/23.mp3"},{"answer":"We figure it's best to keep the day fairly short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. And, um, how do we reserve a place?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/25.mp3"},{"answer":"You sign your name on the notice board.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know where it is?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah ha. I saw it this morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And we do ask that you sign up three days in advance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/29.mp3"},{"answer":"so we know we've got enough people interested to run it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and we can cancel if necessary, with full refund of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/31.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/32.mp3"},{"answer":"And what visits are planned for this term?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, well, I'm afraid the schedule hasn't been printed out yet,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/34.mp3"},{"answer":"but, uh... we have confirmed the dates and planned the optional extra visits","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/35.mp3"},{"answer":"which you can also book in advance if you want to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh that's all right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/37.mp3"},{"answer":"If you can just give some idea of the weekend ones","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/38.mp3"},{"answer":"so I can, you know, work out when to see friends, etcetera.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the first one is St Ives.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That's on the 13th of February","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll have only sixteen places available 'cos we're going by minibus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/43.mp3"},{"answer":"And that's a day in town with the optional extra of visiting the Hepworth Museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right... yeah... that sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's a London trip on the sixteenth of February","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll be taking a medium-sized coach so there'll be 45 places on that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and, let's see, the optional extra is the Tower of London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I've already been there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/49.mp3"},{"answer":"After that there's Bristol on the 3rd of March.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Where?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/51-2024-10-05-21-55-58.mp3"},{"answer":"Bristol...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/52.mp3"},{"answer":"BRISTOL.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That's in a different minibus with 18 places available,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/55.mp3"},{"answer":"oh, and the optional extra is a visit to the S.S. Great Britain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/57.mp3"},{"answer":"We're going to Salisbury on the eighteenth of March","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's always a popular one because the optional extra is Stonehenge,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/59.mp3"},{"answer":"so we're taking the large coach with fifty seats...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/61.mp3"},{"answer":"And then the last one is to Bath on the 23rd of March.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yes. Is Bath the Roman city?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, that's right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and that's in the sixteen-seater minibus.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/65.mp3"},{"answer":"And where's the optional visit?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/66.mp3"},{"answer":"It's to the American Museum - well worth a visit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, well that's great, thanks for all that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/68.mp3"},{"answer":"My pleasure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/69.mp3"},{"answer":"By the way, if you want more information about any of the trips,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/70.mp3"},{"answer":"have a look in the student newspaper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Or, have a word with my assistant;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/73.mp3"},{"answer":"her name is Jane Yentob -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/74.mp3"},{"answer":"that's YENTOB.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, I've got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you very much for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/77.mp3"},{"answer":"You're very welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/78.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you enjoy the trips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-1-part-1-2023-08-10-18-20-29/79.mp3"}]
